# NASA's raw model download: 92 MB, and only an input to `npm run build:model`. Re-fetchable from
# github.com/nasa/NASA-3D-Resources. The 15 MB result in public/models/ *is* tracked — without it
# a clone cannot serve the 3D view.
data/nasa-models/iss-igoal-source.glb

# Process output of the 24/7 collector: these two are just stdout and stderr of a long-running
# process.
data/collect.out
data/collect.err

# The event log of the September campaign, untracked for its duration.
#
# Thinned, it still writes on the order of a hundred megabytes over a fortnight — one line per
# change of sixteen symbols, plus a sample a minute of ten more. That is data, and it does not
# belong in the history of a static site. The liveness log stays tracked: one line a minute is
# two megabytes, and it is the record of when the broadcast was actually up, which is what makes
# every other answer readable.
data/collect-events.jsonl
